  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fef3232cd4dd9d93b860697b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "12a3d75820fc4414b98f3d27daf9918f1ed7624f3f238be344ff606794b30ba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93a237faa7a9670217cb41d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别走丢了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2761aca26e53149b3424b91f59808abbd7b1a063160c1e9cfa98e08cbb38a8ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2711f95801cbb64852b2ac60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d19f3d6c8152a2d4c8f037c30f6e0acacb1244bb59aeeeec217970694b1fd35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:984fcd82558e7aee001d029b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来我似乎太小看你了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb7011527789e737ebe2969932c8c14d20768a57e8832f823e7a2949cf7beeef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efde164f917f121bc0b1b496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你算是做得还不错，就夸夸你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8e73368848fb908db0ea2618e81794fe7e10a2ce885de7e3b5427cd7129944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d01b3b4f5527b986c01c1b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快追上来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1510ea089aee35f57add84da1a8262d492e5ee25ad4a1fcaf0c7f1c1a7da7d12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818aae3a375f43973d6af0f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绷紧神经！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fafe14c523948a653a1bc374df5d06fcaf3c54ed793f1b61b4c898bb6fc12292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0612077d520fd3198709079",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可别让我看到丢脸的竞赛啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e919942fe2f7a823352c96423581407e82eee9ad9964e4dfd5bc381aa3336701",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a34848eead839247d480ece",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你算是做得还不错，就夸夸你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8e73368848fb908db0ea2618e81794fe7e10a2ce885de7e3b5427cd7129944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8932b5ce3ad6340476994f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的选择没有错。\r\n既然如此，今天也只有\r\n胜利在前方等着我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e990b2f479bed6811532a1c6ec5d2e4ff61a3a0f19099e3793446a2b4be6509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7cbe7cc48fc99172a6435c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所有人让开，\r\n今天的胜利是属于我的。\r\n谁也别想碰……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "718c561f626f020519eba1a82ba42ee1486286401850e5bb0610ce9493c25a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd43a977c5e3dcbc1ebaf1e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你算是做得还不错，就夸夸你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8e73368848fb908db0ea2618e81794fe7e10a2ce885de7e3b5427cd7129944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:676f35367851c1dae805e3c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めるぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2964516252c32077b1245d6421664b3d59281a2f368a22c6be11e3dfc5a113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f6c19a6a7366bcd193c423c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我找到该做的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7425fccfa3737b71e7a19e91f021e410e87bf023b02d60158aa5491b58efe478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03228763fbe21aae9063d7aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来找出原因吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "421a9c0b497af36428110645e76aa394c589bfcb02db225d2094ea899a045436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eee55bb9e0f96ffcd91b582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶，太难看了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5ae2b11ad479853cd7a2736450475117715705822b85a76dcc97e93d48ba791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15cadbc2983a81dfc64e9af0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啧，不会有下一次……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad90d2c034042eae35aa4c201bfd6e7b9bbe5e4bd7b9f3a8aa543ad985015b89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8771f13832020c2ce48264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哈哈！\r\n这下明白……谁是最强了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b04afa2f9180dc0bb097f137cc3059b635c9a238ec464e1084921f36fa18d0d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c493795415af40b717c319be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别发呆，进入下个阶段。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05332cb01f49cc887de8c2f9b0c88e1b3cd53a4bd9294bb1d1ca65e9b5f6a012",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c6a1c6079af954b776ba37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "王座是属于我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "110bbf4316c5d4c643ea3721921efa047341f95bd24460ff57267e9e98698b7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc93d8e315fd1982076a1d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看，天狼星即将升起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c79ddd2a19b8adc3a842c833c9fce6e72ab0df2676ff5c53cf3781c4b7b36f67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c6105ffce5f475696cbb99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……鲁道夫。你……\r\n不是自大又傲慢的「皇帝」吗？\r\n既然如此……",
      "source_fingerprint": "14bcea7660c1bf15d68c8e71ab77518cb55759d026682b52ba57858e3e2065f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28cf84ea87aea277be6e8835",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是多伟大的纪录还是记忆……\r\n都会被我的光芒给掩盖！\r\n世界是……属于我的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3e9d7e95c7a4749a605958fad38566737bb9a5087b89bb6fd9f7be0d9faffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d8da0d46b4c77acf885434",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……似乎听到有人在找我？呵，\r\n那些家伙这么没耐性啊？\r\n没办法，就让你们跳只舞吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "173c2717e36959d450c5efeede113ac0f9e85f7dd6f3e74c4509d989b09e57aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38a9d79fea816d96efcb96be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识一下一等星的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "789bcc6904255b7e58a6da3b7cb2eef2e111f63354da6211f7d4945c05e0da02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d9038b90f262ce39a28e8fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小狗，你懂吧？可别移开视线了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1db23726521d52ffb9b7ba69b6fde28d1a9355b6d0f5aa1bd802c5f6d59e7529",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5cfc157ff319b6fbfc08e2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你看见顶点的景色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbddf93b795c0a02d8b0e0a793d12642c3813c2f7096d7d6d9f031ca89d59639",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e87586b4e7c74c0652f33c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你当时的撞球技术可说是\r\n烂到让人发笑呢。\r\n现在的话……勉强还能看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43cd7f3e3e21eedb64a7e750428f431e172ec36ee53e6360f7b4605069b82131",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaacca775aac75727dc9e616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要是不喜欢就不会穿了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08668d32f027fb88038ea4d3481585f4d11875278c17d9fcdb60d40054d0e7a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83aa7ce3c8a719874fa78c7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是什么轻飘飘的……\r\n算了，颜色是不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec74d339f49d6db5b28021e5a3e8da0469391cdc067f266ee2a4150b8cf66de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:609ff76b630d9761fc37a9a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最重要的是设计，\r\n这点我绝不妥协。",
      "source_fingerprint": "848664cd26a1f08d0f7cf8326f5bbb976b607b44d563ca99c6d55d6341841fe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63230ee8469df5327e7c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着它上街便会碰上很多麻烦事。\r\n总之就是很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce24b3c73038ad4afa04ab43e66fe5e85e15e86f44c7c8f0587b0f773d04d1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e1affd4a796fe955219b49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞步这种小事，\r\n我立刻就能记住。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca386183935fb381833b81769254e326d1a2416fc99f92c2a7be3d4c47e8f674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abff80ba0d98b1fa6671c05b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就是穿着这身衣服，\r\n君临于顶点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "478a6e96917dad9135c49579e73e173550b47d2fb45840be7c10a9c3ee59e3e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71608c8c3d007af91ef64fb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可不是换装娃娃哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d2d94b0121ca880ecb10c5e1ef514c5e1bebcfa33a306a4ffcc20674aa08b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f82e85808d08839494d674d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要我陪你玩吗？小狗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "369a1af9dc0dd35db7556c6256b4345be3f0192bcb8b91e1acc50c280021fa6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3df39e20e35ecd24a56b883e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ま、コイツが1番落ち着くな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d4348e7bd55b462ebe6091673a2a0e42c49d9d2107b9d260108b9389e463ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f5c919e81451dc6ba65f66e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "品があるもんのほうが、\r\n肌馴染みはいいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "349c38c9227c555712a1f07df9686cdf4c7fe97ec82c65123ef7cd6364db81ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd6ad160c571a157b7d27c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要是不喜欢就不会穿了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08668d32f027fb88038ea4d3481585f4d11875278c17d9fcdb60d40054d0e7a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
